       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. CPM-TOMIE-23TREE-QUADTREE.
       ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01  WS-QUADTREE-PROOFS.
           05  WS-MERKLE-STRUCT-OK         PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-LOD-PYRAMID-OK           PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-DATBIN-MEDIA-OK          PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-AFFINE-REDRAW-OK         PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-QUADTREE-SEAL-OK         PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
       01  WS-QUADTREE-SYNTHESIS.
           05  WS-ALL-QUADTREE-PROVEN      PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
           05  WS-TOTAL-QUADTREE-CODE      PIC 9(01) VALUE 1.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       0000-MAIN-LOGIC.
           PERFORM 1000-EVALUATE-MERKLE-AND-LOD.
           PERFORM 2000-EVALUATE-MEDIA-AND-REDRAW.
           PERFORM 3000-SYNTHESIZE-QUADTREE-PROOFS.
           GOBACK.
       1000-EVALUATE-MERKLE-AND-LOD.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-MERKLE-STRUCT-OK.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-LOD-PYRAMID-OK.
       2000-EVALUATE-MEDIA-AND-REDRAW.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-DATBIN-MEDIA-OK.
           MOVE 1 TO WS-AFFINE-REDRAW-OK.
       3000-SYNTHESIZE-QUADTREE-PROOFS.
           IF WS-MERKLE-STRUCT-OK = 1 AND
              WS-LOD-PYRAMID-OK = 1 AND
              WS-DATBIN-MEDIA-OK = 1 AND
              WS-AFFINE-REDRAW-OK = 1
               MOVE 1 TO WS-QUADTREE-SEAL-OK
               MOVE 1 TO WS-ALL-QUADTREE-PROVEN
               MOVE 1 TO WS-TOTAL-QUADTREE-CODE
           ELSE
               MOVE 0 TO WS-ALL-QUADTREE-PROVEN
               MOVE 0 TO WS-TOTAL-QUADTREE-CODE.
